# --- Added 2026-09-23 -------------------------------------------------------
# region_service_available's normalized-state fallback
# (20260923212037_region_service_available_normalized_state_fallback.sql, plus its
# same-day 20260923213439_fix_region_service_available_review_findings.sql
# follow-up): a casing/whitespace/"...State"-suffix variant of profiles.state --
